          "line_end": 82,
          "line_start": 77,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "egoist/waku",
          "url": "https://github.com/egoist/waku/blob/968d42dd38b78d28f46c36abb3d00410a4759957/README.md#L77-L82"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_9276752b023b15163e2fc39b05e785a9155ff6e1d6929eb9fd7580e9f85efbe0"
      ],
      "text": "The desktop's Settings → Daemon page can expose the child daemon on a fixed port, configure exact browser origins, and copy its stable authentication token; the daemon remains loopback-only by default."
    },
