      ],
      "text": "Waku detects installed agent CLIs automatically and uses each provider's native structured protocol and session continuity; supported agents include Amp, Claude Code, Codex CLI, Cursor CLI, Fx, Grok Build, Kimi Code, OpenCode, and Pi."
    },
